vgcfgrestore restores the metadata of a VG from a text backup file
produced by
.BR vgcfgbackup (8).
This writes VG metadata onto the devices specified in the backup file.
.P
A backup file can be specified with \fB--file\fP.  If no backup file is
specified, the most recent one is used. Use \fB--list\fP for a list of
the available backup and archive files of a VG.
.P
WARNING: When a VG contains thin pools, changes to thin metadata cannot be
reverted, and data loss may occur if thin metadata has changed. The force
option is required to restore in this case.
